<title>BELGIUM: Belgian November budget deficit widens.</title>
<headline>Belgian November budget deficit widens.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian federal state's net borrowing requirement widened to 17 billion francs in November from 7.2 billion in the year-ago month, the finance and budget ministries said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The cumulative borrowing requirement for the first 11 months of 1996 narrowed to 341.8 billion francs from 365.7 billion in the same period last year.</p>
